.TH AVR\-SBOM\-DOWNLOAD 1 "" "avr 0.4.0" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-sbom-download \- Download an SBOM artifact (CycloneDX, SPDX, or dependency inventory).
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr sbom download
[OPTIONS] [COMMIT]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Download an SBOM artifact (CycloneDX, SPDX, or dependency inventory).
.PP
COMMIT is the commit of a recorded SBOM, as a full SHA or a unique prefix of at least 7 characters such as the one `avr sbom list` shows. Defaults to the latest SBOM.
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
Examples:
    avr sbom download --repo acme/api
    avr sbom download --repo acme/api --format spdx --out api.spdx.json
    avr sbom download 3f2c9a1b7d04 --repo acme/api --out - | jq .components
.fi
.RE
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
[\fICOMMIT\fR]
\&
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-repo\fR \fITEXT\fR
Repository (org/repo or rep-xxx). Auto-detected from git remote if omitted.
.TP
\fB\-\-org\fR \fITEXT\fR
Organization ID or slug. Uses default org if not specified (see: avr config set org).
.TP
\fB\-\-commit\fR \fITEXT\fR
Same as the COMMIT argument.
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR \fICHOICE\fR
Artifact to download. (choices: cyclonedx, inventory, spdx; default: cyclonedx)
.TP
\fB\-\-out\fR \fITEXT\fR
Output file path, or "-" for stdout. Defaults to the artifact filename in the current directory.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR avr (1),
.BR avr-sbom (1),
.BR avr-sbom-generate (1),
.BR avr-sbom-list (1),
.BR avr-sbom-view (1)
